This project builds on, and contains code derived from, the following works:

- DreamZero (https://github.com/dreamzero0/dreamzero), NVIDIA GEAR Lab, Apache License 2.0.
  jetson/apply_patches.py modifies a DreamZero checkout at install time; jetson/dz_lowmem.py
  replaces DreamZero's VLA.from_pretrained and wraps WANPolicyHead.encode_prompt at runtime.
  dreamzero_hil/client.py follows the request format of dreamzero eval_utils/run_sim_eval.py and
  eval_utils/policy_client.py (itself adapted from https://github.com/robo-arena/roboarena).
  DreamZero model weights (GEAR-Dreams/DreamZero-DROID on Hugging Face) are not included.

- openpi-client (https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi, packages/openpi-client),
  Physical Intelligence, Apache License 2.0. dreamzero_hil/_openpi/msgpack_numpy.py and
  image_tools.py are unmodified copies.

- sim-evals (https://github.com/arhanjain/sim-evals). dreamzero_hil/droid_sim/ is a port of its
  DROID environment configuration to Isaac Lab 3. sim-evals has no license file at the time of
  writing; its scene and robot USD assets (Hugging Face owhan/DROID-sim-environments) are not
  redistributed and are downloaded by scripts/download_assets.sh.

- Isaac Sim / Isaac Lab (NVIDIA) are required at runtime and are not included.
